{"id":"31fb1fed988b718a","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics.md","title":"Minimality of the Constructible Universe","display":"thm-inner-model-theory-basics — Minimality of the Constructible Universe","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics","aliases":["58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics","Inner Model Theory Basics","Minimality of L"],"display":"thm-inner-model-theory-basics — Minimality of the Constructible Universe","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","[[58-df-inner-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-inner-model-theory-basics</span><span>Inner Model Theory Basics</span><span>Minimality of L</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-inner-model-theory-basics — Minimality of the Constructible Universe"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" href=\"?note=5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" title=\"58-df-inner-model\">58-df-inner-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,M\">\\(L,M\\)</span> 是元理论中的类变元；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是可构造宇宙（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\">\\(\\forall^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\\)</span> 表示元层的类全称量词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 标记该断言属于类元理论而非集合对象语言</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S\\)</span> 是作用于类变元的内模型谓词（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" href=\"?note=5a435dbfefa9e0ed\" title=\"58-df-inner-model\">58-df-inner-model</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inner\\text{-}model\\text{-}theory\\text{-}basics}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(L)\\land\n\\forall^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(M)\\to L\\subseteq M\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}inner\\text{-}model\\text{-}theory\\text{-}basics}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(L)\\land\n\\forall^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{InnerModel}_S(M)\\to L\\subseteq M\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> is the least inner model under inclusion.</li>\n<li>The theorem concerns <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>; specialized inner models such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L[U]\">\\(L[U]\\)</span> and core models require additional hypotheses and separate definitions.</li>\n<li>内模型包含全部序数，因而不能把这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 当作集合量词的取值；最小性断言必须在类元理论中读取。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"